        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Version 0.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:49:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Sign in with GitHub directly (via the Invoca Protobooth GitHub App) instead of pasting a personal access token</li>
                    <li>Open Session: paste a DevSpace prototype URL to check out its chat history and versions locally, with a prompt to pull when a newer version is published</li>
                    <li>Published versions now show who published them</li>
                    <li>Organize prototypes into folders in the sidebar, with drag-to-reorder and collapse/expand</li>
                    <li>A new prototype appears in the sidebar immediately, gets an AI-suggested name after its first generation, and can be renamed manually at any time</li>
                    <li>Sidebar rows show a live loading indicator while a prototype is generating</li>
                    <li>Switch freely between prototypes while one is generating — work on several at once without losing progress</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Invoca/style-guide/protobooth-manifest/manifests/protobooth.dmg"
                sparkle:edSignature="TtlFxGzsiI5JcD2sIiHsyOTRTgMuEIzEYFX62s6DwIjHlPTmde3EFVjNJz4FY3yFZ4T/fnMMDQjb3jS64yElAw=="
                length="3650867"
                type="application/x-apple-diskimage" />
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Version 0.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:17:53 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Fix a bug where a stray trailing newline/space from copy-pasting an API key or GitHub PAT into Settings would silently corrupt the stored credential, causing the first design attempt to fail with a generic error</li>
                    <li>Show the real error (HTTP status and response body) instead of a generic message when a GitHub or Anthropic request fails</li>
                    <li>Add placeholder hints (sk-ant-..., ghp_...) to the Settings fields</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Invoca/style-guide/protobooth-manifest/manifests/protobooth.dmg"
                sparkle:edSignature="AyH/Z2VxyxCaIMZWeB2ST78B+HPZyYDsmpfeBkGPfvgpltyuGuOmVusiPUxs4WCOVa5+/QgZZU9F7Hr0hAKyCA=="
                length="2923235"
                type="application/x-apple-diskimage" />
        </item>
